Name:           tux64
Version:        %{tux_version}
Release:        1
Summary:        TUX 64 - The Kernel Castle Adventure, a fan-made 3D penguin platformer
License:        Unspecified
BuildArch:      x86_64
Recommends:     alsa-lib

%description
A 3D action platformer starring Tux. Collect stars across snowy and icy
worlds reached through the Kernel Castle, fight bosses and race. All
graphics, music and sound effects are generated by the program itself.
Requires OpenGL and X11; sound uses ALSA when available.

%install
cp -a %{tux_root}/. %{buildroot}/

%files
/usr/bin/tux64
/usr/share/applications/tux64.desktop
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/tux64.png
%doc /usr/share/doc/tux64/README.md
